OL,5,G2000 All Creatures Great and Small
OL,6,     FJames Herriot follows his dream to
OL,7,     Fbecome a vet in the magnificent
OL,8,     FYorkshire Dales. He soon discovers
OL,9,     Fthat treating the animals is as
OL,10,     Fmuch about treating their owners.
OL,11,G2100 Waterloo Road
OL,12,     FNew headmaster Jack takes the
OL,13,     Freins, endeavouring to improve the
OL,14,     Fschool's status. Colleagues Tom
OL,15,     Fand Lorna tie the knot - but the
OL,16,     Fgroom ends up kissing someone who
OL,17,     Fisn't his new wife.
